ional content pointer, along with function pointers for getting signed data and setting type/data."}, {"name": "ANSC_ASN1_SIGNEDDATA", "description": "Represents the SignedData ASN.1 object, including fields for version, digest algorithms, content info, certificates, CRLs, and signer infos, with associated function pointers for operations like adding digests, certificates, and verifying."}, {"name": "ANSC_ASN1_DIGESTALGORITHMIDENTIFIERS", "description": "SetOf DigestAlgorithmIdentifier structures used in SignedData."}, {"name": "ANSC_ASN1_CERTIFICATES", "description": "SetOf Certificate objects used to hold certificates within cryptographic data structures."}, {"name": "ANSC_ASN1_CERTIFICATEREVOCATIONLISTS", "description": "SetOf CRL objects for certificate revocation lists."}, {"name": "ANSC_ASN1_SIGNERINFOS", "description": "SetOf SignerInfo objects describing signers."}, {"name": "ANSC_ASN1_SIGNERINFO", "description": "Sequence representing individual signer info, including issuer and serial number, digest algorithm, signed attributes, encrypted digest, and unauthenticated attributes."}, {"name": "ANSC_ASN1_ISSUERANDSERIALNUMBER", "description": "Sequence containing issuer name and serial number, used to identify certificate issuers."}, {"name": "ANSC_ASN1_DIGESTENCRYPTIONALGORITHMIDENTIFIER", "description": "AlgorithmIdentifier for digest encryption algorithms."}, {"name": "ANSC_ASN1_ENCRYPTEDDIGEST", "description": "OctetString representing encrypted digest data."}, {"name": "ANSC_ASN1_DIGESTINFO", "description": "Sequence containing digest algorithm identifier and digest octet string."}, {"name": "ANSC_ASN1_ENVELOPEDDATA", "description": "Sequence representing EnvelopedData structure with version, recipient infos, and encrypted content info."}, {"name": "ANSC_ASN1_RECIPIENTINFOS", "description": "SetOf RecipientInfo objects."}, {"name": "ANSC_ASN1_ENCRYPTEDCONTENTINFO", "description": "Sequence for encrypted content, including content type, encryption algorith